owrap\">250 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\"><img alt=\"White Mushroom\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Mushroom_c1cb03.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Mushroom\">White Mushroom</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">6 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Aurelia.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: hi<br/>\nAurelia: Welcome to my <b>shop</b>! Are you looking for a <b>trade</b>?<br/>\nPlayer: name<br/>\nAurelia: My name is Aurelia.<br/>\nPlayer: job<br/>\nAurelia: I am the shop owner here, if you're interested ask me for a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: shop<br/>\nAurelia: I am selling all kinds of equipment. Let me know if you're interested in a <b>trade</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: time<br/>\nAurelia: It is <i>time</i>.<br/>\nPlayer: quest<br/>\nAurelia: I don't need any help right now. But maybe Sterling does. You can find him at the beach west of the depot.<br/>\nPlayer: bank<br/>\nAurelia: At the bank you can stash gold and trade currencies. You should talk to <b>Adrian</b> for financial services.<br/>\nPlayer: main<br/>\nAurelia: This is the main continent of Tibia. If you seek a passage, ask Captain <b>Indigo</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: king<br/>\nAurelia: Our king is Tibianus III.<br/>\nPlayer: Targuna<br/>\nAurelia: That's the name of our little island here. Emiliana told me that it's an old word for turtle. Hmm, I wonder if that has anything to do with Sterling's turtle? Who knows.<br/>\nPlayer: Thais<br/>\nAurelia: Thais is a really big city, my friend. If you seek a passage, ask Captain <b>Indigo</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: Adrian<br/>\nAurelia: Adrian is my husband and takes care of all financial matters here in <b>Targuna</b>. You can find him at the <b>bank</b> across the street.<br/>\nPlayer: Aurelia<br/>\nAurelia: That's my name, friend.<br/>\nPlayer: Camilla<br/>\nAurelia: Camilla is kind of like the mayor here. You can find her in her apartment above the depot.<br/>\nPlayer: Indigo<br/>\nAurelia: Indigo has the most beautiful hair! Blue like the sea. You can find her on the ship east of here. She is a captain of the Royal Tibia Line and can take you to our capital, the city of Thais.<br/>\nPlayer: Leonora<br/>\nAurelia: Oh, Leonora is a good friend of mine. If you want to send parcels or letters, she's the right person to talk to, because she runs the post office here.<br/>\nPlayer: Tibianus<br/>\nAurelia: He is our king and resides in the capital <b>Thais</b>.<br/>\nPlayer: bye / farewell<br/>\nAurelia: Farewell, adventurer.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Aurelia</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["targuna-quest"],"pos":{"x":31955,"y":31916,"z":7}}